JEEENE KE ZAMANE ME QASIM MAIDAAN ME MARNE JAATEY HAI<br>
 SHABBIR DAR E KHAIMA PE KHADE AANKHOU SE LAHOO BARSAATEY HAIN<br>
<br>
1. BHAI KI WASIYAT PER HUMKO KARNA HAI AMAL AYE MERE JAARI <br>
 ABBAS SE DILAWAR SE ROKERYEH SIBTE NABI FARMATEY HAIN<br>
<br>
2. KOHRAAM BAPA HAI FOUJAO MEIN HILTI HAI ZAMEEN E KARBOBALA <br>
 HYDER KI TARAH RAN ME QASIM ANDAZ E WEGA DEKHLATEY HAI<br>
<br>
3. EK HASR BAPA HAI MAIDAAN MEIN HULCHAL HAI YAZEEDI LASHKER MEIN <br>
 GHOODE SE GIRA RAN MEIN QASIM SHABBIR MADAD KO JAATEY HAIN<br>
<br>
4. GHOUDON KE SUMOO SE IS DARJA PAMAAL HUWA QASIM KA BADAN <br>
 CHADER MEIN LAPETE LASHE KO PHULOU KI TARAH SHEH LAATEY HAIN<br>
<br>
5. KHAIMEIN MEIN SHAH E DEEN SE FIZZA YEH AHLE HARAM SE KEHTI THI <br>
 FARWA KE PISAR KO GODI MEIN SHABBIR UTHA KE LAATE HAIN<br>
<br>
6. KYA BAAT HUWI KYU HOTA HAI SHADI KE GHARANE ME MATAM<br>
 KYUN CHAAK GARIBAN ROOTEY HUWE QASIM KE BARATI AATE HAI<br>
<br>
<br>
7. ANSAAR E HUSSAINI PYASE HAI PYASI HAI DULHAN PYASA DULHA <br>
 HAR SAAL YEH SHADI KR MANZER HAR AHLE AZA KO RULATEY HAIN<br>
<br>
8. AYE AHLE AZA SOUCHO TOH ZARA JIS TARHA SE KUBRA NE PEHNA <br>
 IS TARHA RANDAAP E KA JOODA DULHAN KO KAHI PEHNATE HAI<br>
<br>
9. YEH FAIZ E HUSSAINI HAI MAZHER KEHTE HAIN FARISHTE ROZ E JAZAN <br>
 SURAJ KI TARHA MATAM KE NISAAN TAQDEER TERI CHAMKATEY HAIN<br>
